<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">  CUDA[&quot;CUDA&lt;br/&gt;编程模型&quot;] --&gt; SM[&quot;SM&lt;br/&gt;计算分区&quot;]</span></span>
